# Entomb fills Bot1's graveyard before shuffling can affect the setup. It holds a mana-value-5 creature, Clone (4), Grizzly Bears (2), and Entomb itself. At exactly ten charge counters Reliant becomes a 4/3 flyer. Its entry trigger returns Clone, which copies Gigantosaurus; combat damage returns Grizzly Bears, untapped. Opponent graveyard, noncreature, and mana-value-5 targets are refused at both triggers (CR 702.184, 608.2b).

